{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ明日はー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ndシングル「おいでシャンプー」発売日＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろぐるぐるカーテンとか左胸とか聴き飽きてきたっしょ??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からは1日中おいでシャンプーをリピートするべし!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ狼に口笛をもよろしくね(^^)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月2日のセカンドシングル発売決定おめでとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと私の誕生日の前日、最高の誕プレです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「おいシャン」のＣＤと、ひめたんのコメントと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高のプレゼントになりますようにー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるぐるカーテン発売イベントお疲れさまでした!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振り返ってみてどうですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということでー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は大阪の総括&コメント返しで振り返りしようω!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、全握の時、ひめたんちょっと辛そうだったよね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の体調は大丈夫かな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー心配かけてごめんなさい('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんときは暑さからか、途中不覚にもぼーっとしてしまった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にごめんなさいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休憩中に水分糖分とってごろーんしてたから復活しましたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はもちろん元気すぎる(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪で美味しいものは沢山食べれたかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"差し入れりすと!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たこ焼き、豚まん、堂島ロール、串カツ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部食べたら間違いなくぶたさんになっちゃうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"串カツ食べた?串カツは好き?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケータリングで食べた♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"串カツ好きよ!大阪流のタレ二度つけ禁止!みたいな串カツ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度食べてみたーい(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タコ焼きのタコは誰にあげたん?笑っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるん(斎藤ちはるchan)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんがタコだけ出してお皿の外に追いやってたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しいるんるんが食べてくれた(*^^*)さーすが!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪のお土産何買ったのかなー?(*・ω・*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんも買えんかった...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中京都と静岡のインターにも降りたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝ぼけててすっかりだった('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自己紹介の時は、年甲斐になく、大声でひめたんと叫んでいたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"届いたでしょうか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"としなんて関係なーい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"届きましたよ♪ありがとうございます(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪終わって、何か達成感があったかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1stシングル「ぐるぐるカーテン」も終わりかあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで頑張ってきたな。レッスンや撮影やなんやらかんやらあったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わっちゃうなんて寂しいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな人に出会えたな。辛いこともあったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２ヶ月みんなと一緒に頑張ってこれてよかった(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして宿題に出してた大阪みやげ教えてくださーい!の回答(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご協力ありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪のお土産で一度は食べてほしいのは551蓬莱の豚まんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱたこ焼きとかですか(笑)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"定番といえば「551蓬莱の豚まん」かな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪行った時はたいてい蓬莱551のぶたまんを買うよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「たこ焼き」でしょ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"551の肉まんかなあ(^_^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃがりこタコ焼き味とかはオススメです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベタだけど、551の蓬莱かな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たこ焼きぐらいしか思いつかないやσ(^_^;)ww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たこべえってお菓子おいしいよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんご協力ありがとうございましーた♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来た意見をあえて全部載せるのが中元流どや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみやげにはできんかったけど、ひめたん自身が食べれたけ満足∩^ω^∩わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"551は今なら池袋西武で買えるみたい!5/6まで!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って教えていただいたのでみなさん行くしかー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/01/8369245/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}